      317.52,
      560.44,
      363.59
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1Name of the land: Millagahalanda; Discription of the Land:Garden, A permanent building; Claimant: A.D.K.Dharmasiri,No.262, Parakandeniya, Imbulgoda;; Extent: 0.0152 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      323.28,
      377.52,
      560.79,
      495.59
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Gampaha Divisional Secretariat on the 08th day of May2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 29th day of April, 2019the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
